<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns raised its rating of Motorola Inc to attractive from neutral, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Late Thursday, Motorola reported better-than-expected fourth quarter earnings of $0.39 a share, compared to $0.72 a share last year. The current results included more than $150 million in restructuring and other charges.</p>
<p>-- Motorola gained 2-7/8 to 66-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
